<!doctype html>
<html>
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <style>
      body { font-family: Georgia, "Times New Roman", Times, serif; font-size: 12pt; line-height: 1.4; text-align: justify; color: #111; }
      h1 { font-size: 16pt; text-align: center; margin: 0 0 12pt; }
      .watermark {
        position: fixed;
        top: 45%;
        left: 50%;
        transform: translate(-50%, -50%) rotate(-30deg);
        font-size: 64pt;
        font-weight: 700;
        color: rgba(0,0,0,0.06);
        letter-spacing: 2px;
        white-space: nowrap;
        pointer-events: none;
        z-index: -1;
      }
      .footer {
        position: fixed;
        bottom: 1cm;
        left: 0;
        right: 0;
        text-align: center;
        font-size: 10pt;
        color: #333;
      }
      .section { margin-bottom: 10pt; }
      ol { padding-left: 1.3cm; }
      li { margin-bottom: 8pt; }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <div class="watermark">CONFIDENTIAL</div>
    <h1>RENTAL AGREEMENT</h1>

    <div class="section">
      This Rental Agreement ("Agreement") is executed on {{start_date}} between:
      <br/><br/>
      <b>Landlord:</b> {{landlord_name}}, {{landlord_address}}
      <br/>
      <b>Tenant:</b> {{tenant_name}}, {{tenant_address}}
      <br/><br/>
      <b>Property:</b> {{property_address}}
      <br/><br/>
      <b>Monthly Rent:</b> {{monthly_rent_figures}} ({{monthly_rent_words}})
      <br/>
      <b>Deposit Amount:</b> {{deposit_amount}}
      <br/>
      <b>City:</b> {{city}}
      <br/><br/>
      <b>Term:</b> {{duration_months}} months starting from {{start_date}}.
    </div>

    <ol>
      <li>
        <b>Rent and Payment Schedule.</b> The tenant shall pay monthly rent of {{monthly_rent_figures}} on or before the due date of each month. Any delay may result in charges as permitted under applicable law.
      </li>
      <li>
        <b>Deposit.</b> The tenant shall pay the deposit amount of {{deposit_amount}} to the landlord at the time of execution. The deposit shall be adjustable against lawful dues at the end of the tenancy.
      </li>
      <li>
        <b>Use of Property.</b> The tenant shall use the property only for lawful residential/commercial purposes as mutually agreed and shall not cause nuisance.
      </li>
      <li>
        <b>Maintenance and Repairs.</b> The tenant shall keep the premises in good condition for reasonable wear and tear. Major structural repairs shall be the landlord's responsibility.
      </li>
      <li>
        <b>Term and Termination.</b> The agreement shall continue for {{duration_months}} months unless terminated earlier by written notice in compliance with law.
      </li>
      <li>
        <b>Utilities and Charges.</b> Utilities, society charges, and other recurring expenses shall be borne as agreed, including timely payment by the tenant where applicable.
      </li>
      <li>
        <b>Alterations.</b> Any alterations or renovations shall require prior written consent of the landlord.
      </li>
      <li>
        <b>Return of Possession.</b> Upon expiry/termination, the tenant shall hand over vacant possession in good condition and clear all dues.
      </li>
      <li>
        <b>Governing Law and Jurisdiction.</b> This Agreement shall be governed by laws applicable in India and subject to the courts in {{city}}.
      </li>
    </ol>

    <div style="margin-top: 18pt;">
      <div style="display:flex; justify-content: space-between;">
        <div style="width: 45%;">
          <div><b>Landlord</b></div>
          <div style="margin-top: 36pt;">Name: {{landlord_name}}</div>
        </div>
        <div style="width: 45%;">
          <div><b>Tenant</b></div>
          <div style="margin-top: 36pt;">Name: {{tenant_name}}</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="footer">This document is generated by NextGenLegal and is legally valid under Indian law</div>
  </body>
</html>

